WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:01.640
- Well what's the
girliest thing you've done

00:00:01.640 --> 00:00:02.473
with your girls?

00:00:02.473 --> 00:00:04.320
'Cause we have a lot of, like,

00:00:04.320 --> 00:00:06.040
are they called girl daddy's?

00:00:06.040 --> 00:00:07.130
I think that's what kind of the terms.

00:00:07.130 --> 00:00:09.600
We've had a lot of them on
this show, and I love that.

00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:13.700
- I'm involved in all
levels of what goes on,

00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:15.580
but I'm under a lot of pressure

00:00:15.580 --> 00:00:17.758
to have my toenails and
fingernails painted.

00:00:17.758 --> 00:00:19.100
(audience laughs)
A lot of pressure.

00:00:19.100 --> 00:00:19.933
- They're wanting you

00:00:19.933 --> 00:00:21.100
to really get into that?
- There they are, yeah.

00:00:21.100 --> 00:00:21.940
- I will be honest with you,

00:00:21.940 --> 00:00:24.470
I've seen my husband paint
my daughter's toenails,

00:00:24.470 --> 00:00:26.140
our eldest, when we first got together,

00:00:26.140 --> 00:00:28.096
and he does a really good job.

00:00:28.096 --> 00:00:28.929
(audience laughs)

00:00:28.929 --> 00:00:30.490
- Like, better than me.
- I've found out

00:00:30.490 --> 00:00:32.260
that I'm not bad at
braiding hair recently.

00:00:32.260 --> 00:00:33.890
- He's good at that too.

00:00:33.890 --> 00:00:35.540
Yeah, I don't know, he
had horses growing up,

00:00:35.540 --> 00:00:37.930
so maybe because he did that
with their mane, I don't know.

00:00:37.930 --> 00:00:39.540
- I'm terrible at it, braiding.

00:00:39.540 --> 00:00:41.380
- Oh I can braid, I played sports.

00:00:41.380 --> 00:00:45.370
- I'm really bad at the hair,
I'm good at the pretending.

00:00:45.370 --> 00:00:48.000
So like the tea parties, and like,

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:51.250
when I'm cast as,
sometimes I'm stepmother,

00:00:51.250 --> 00:00:52.877
or I'm, you know what I mean?
(audience laughs)

00:00:52.877 --> 00:00:53.710
- I'm good

00:00:53.710 --> 00:00:54.640
at the pretending stuff.
- That's creative,

00:00:54.640 --> 00:00:55.473
I like that.

00:00:55.473 --> 00:00:56.306
- Yeah, yeah, yeah, but I'm not good

00:00:56.306 --> 00:00:57.200
at the hair braiding
- How many kids do you have?

00:00:57.200 --> 00:00:59.330
- Just one, one little girl.
- One little girl, how old?

00:00:59.330 --> 00:01:00.560
- She'll be three.
- [Other Guest] Three,

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:01.760
awesome. Congratulations.

00:01:01.760 --> 00:01:03.870
- Actually, isn't her birthday April 23rd?

00:01:03.870 --> 00:01:04.703
- That's right.

00:01:04.703 --> 00:01:05.570
- A day before mine.

00:01:05.570 --> 00:01:06.403
- Get out of here.

00:01:06.403 --> 00:01:08.013
- She's gonna be amazing.
- Taurus, Taurus women.

00:01:08.910 --> 00:01:10.383
You'll let me know what I'm in for?

00:01:10.383 --> 00:01:11.216
Please tell me.
(audience laughs)

00:01:11.216 --> 00:01:14.070
- You know what, buckle up.

00:01:14.070 --> 00:01:15.773
We're sweet until we're not.

